Package: LandS
Type: Package
Title: Integrated Tools for Longitudinal Biomarker, Survival, and Clinical Data Analysis
Version: 1.8.8
Author: Stefano Bergamini, Luca Lalli, Jessica Gliozzo 
Maintainer: Stefano Bergamini <stefano.bergamini@istitutotumori.mi.it>
Description: Provides tools for longitudinal, survival, and exploratory analysis 
    of clinical and biomarker data. The package includes utilities for descriptive 
    statistics, correlation analysis, Cox proportional hazards models, Kaplan-Meier 
    visualization, longitudinal trajectory plotting, outlier detection, formatted 
    statistical reporting, and publication-ready tables and figures. Additional 
    functionality supports translational proteomics workflows, including Olink data 
    handling and pathway-analysis preparation. Functions are designed to simplify 
    reproducible analysis pipelines and generation of presentation-ready outputs.
